STATUS  CHECK         DETAIL
warn    git provider  GitHub (github.com): gh is not installed; glab is not installed, so saddle runs local-only: no PRs (saddle prs, publish and auto-merge are off) and no merge-settings, branch-protection or gh-stack checks; agents, claims and the merge train still work
FAIL    claude        claude not on PATH
FAIL    agent CLIs    no agent CLI is installed and logged in: claude not on PATH; codex not on PATH; grok not on PATH

You need to do this:
  - claude (the Claude Code CLI the agents run in)
      claude not on PATH
      fix: install Claude Code (https://claude.com/claude-code) or set [claude] cmd in .saddle/config.toml
  - agent CLIs (the agent CLIs (claude, codex, grok) installed and logged in, and which one saddle up runs)
      no agent CLI is installed and logged in: claude not on PATH; codex not on PATH; grok not on PATH
      fix: install Claude Code: npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code (https://claude.com/claude-code), then claude /login; or install the Grok CLI, then grok login; or install the Codex CLI: npm install -g @openai/codex (https://github.com/openai/codex), then codex login

Optional:
  - git provider (where the repo is hosted (GitHub or GitLab) and its CLI, gh or glab, logged in, which saddle uses to open and merge PRs)
      GitHub (github.com): gh is not installed; glab is not installed, so saddle runs local-only: no PRs (saddle prs, publish and auto-merge are off) and no merge-settings, branch-protection or gh-stack checks; agents, claims and the merge train still work
      fix: install the GitHub CLI (https://cli.github.com), then gh auth login --hostname github.com
